    "Since app launch, for RIPEstat HTTPS diagnostics only. Includes measured HTTP headers and bodies. Does not include cache hits, ping, traceroute, or other apps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从应用启动累计，仅统计 RIPEstat HTTPS 诊断测得的请求与响应头及正文；不含缓存命中、Ping、路由追踪或其他应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The latest 12 observed changes during foreground monitoring; an empty list does not mean normal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示前台监控期间最近收到的 12 条变化。列表为空不代表正常。"
